---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="锦乃｜东京都千代田区 皇居/江户城 二之丸庭园｜WORKS"
  description=""
>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <!-- Background -->

  <picture>

    <source
      media="(max-width: 768px)"
      srcset="/images/edoninomarugarden-mobile.jpg"
    />

    <img
      src="/images/edoninomarugarden.jpg"
      alt="江户城 二之丸庭园"
      class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

  </picture>

<!-- Dark Overlay -->

  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#f6f1e7]/85 via-[#f6f1e7]/45 to-transparent"></div>


  <!-- Content -->

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <!-- English -->

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          EDO CASTLE NINOMARU GARDEN
        </p>

        <!-- Title -->

        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[48px] leading-[1.15] text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          江户城二之丸庭园
        </h1>

        <!-- Subtitle -->

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-xl text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          延续至今的将军家渊源庭园。
        </p>

        <!-- Gold Divider -->

        <div class="mt-1">

          <img
            src="/images/gold-divider.png"
            alt=""
            class="w-[420px] h-auto select-none pointer-events-none"
            draggable="false"
          />

        </div>

        <!-- Summary -->

        <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl">

        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>

  <!-- Scroll -->

  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>

<!-- Introduction -->

<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <!-- Washi Background -->

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />

  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        作品概要
      </h2>

      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        位于东京都千代田区皇居东御苑的二之丸庭园，其历史可追溯至江户城二之丸所设的庭园，是一座具有悠久历史的庭园。
        <br>
        江户时代，这座庭园与将军家的御殿一同修建，并作为传为小堀远州所作的庭园逐渐发展起来。
        <br>
        幕末二之丸御殿烧毁后，庭园逐渐荒废，但池塘仍然保留下来，从明治、大正、昭和前期的地图以及战后的航空照片中，也可以确认其存在。
        <br>
        现今的庭园于昭和43年（1968年）以江户时代的庭园绘图为基础，重新整备为池泉回游式庭园，其池塘所在位置与江户时代的池塘大致相同。
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl"></div>

    <!-- Information -->

    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

      <!-- Left -->

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          关于皇居/江户城二之丸庭园
        </h2>

        <p 
  class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]" 
  style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;" 
>

江户城二之丸是与本丸相邻的区域，曾设有与将军家御台所相关的御殿。二之丸御殿的东侧延伸着以池泉为中心的庭园，据传其营造与小堀远州有关。

<br><br>

至幕末的万延元年（1860年）前后，包括二之丸御殿在内的主要御殿群仍然保存着，庭园也作为从御殿眺望的景观而得到整备。

<br><br>

二之丸御殿于庆应3年（1867年）烧毁。明治以后，庭园逐渐荒废，但池塘此后仍被保留下来。通过明治4年（1871年）的《二丸池图》，以及明治、大正、昭和前期的地图和战后的航空照片等资料，也可以追溯其变迁。

<br><br>

现今的二之丸庭园是在昭和43年（1968年）皇居东御苑整备期间重新整备的，并以江户时代的庭园绘图为基础，恢复为池泉回游式庭园。现在的二之丸池，其位置也与江户时代庭园中的池塘大致相同。

<br><br>

本作品以幕末时期的二之丸庭园为基本依据，并参考现存地形、照片以及史料中可以确认的庭园变迁进行复原。因此，也参考了现今二之丸庭园中仍然存在的桥梁与景观。

<br><br>

此外，还一并复原了二之丸东三重橹附近的筑山，以及以乳白色池底为特征的水井等二之丸内具有代表性的地点。

</p>


      </div>

      <!-- DATA -->

      <aside class="relative">

        <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]">

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>

          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品名称</p>
              <p class="text-base">江户城 二之丸庭园</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">分类</p>
              <p class="text-base">日本庭园</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作时间</p>
              <p class="text-base">2天</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">所在地</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                〒100-0001 东京都千代田区千代田一丁目1番
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">基本年代</p>
              <p class="text-base">万延元年（1860年）前后</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">时代</p>
              <p class="text-base">江户时代・幕末</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">形式</p>
              <p class="text-base">池泉回游式庭园</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作软件</p>
              <p class="text-base">我的世界 Java版 v1.21.10</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品分类</p>
              <p class="text-base">日式建筑・历史景观复原</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作状态</p>
              <p class="text-base">完成</p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>

    <!-- Gallery -->

    <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          GALLERY
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-4xl"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        展示照片
      </h2>

      <div class="gallery mt-12">

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/edoninomarugarden0.jpg"
            alt="江户城 二之丸庭园 全景"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/edoninomarugarden1.png"
            alt="江户城 二之丸庭园"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/edoninomarugarden2.png"
            alt="江户城 二之丸庭园"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/edoninomarugarden3.png"
            alt="江户城 二之丸庭园"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Back -->

    <div class="mt-24">

      <a
        href="/zh-cn/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← 返回作品列表
      </a>


      <a
        href="https://youtube.com/shorts/nAJFOeyV4T8"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        观看视频 →
      </a>

      <a
        href="/zh-cn/edocastle/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        查看更多 →
      </a>

<!-- Share -->

<div class="mt-32 text-center">

  <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

    <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

    <p
      class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
      style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
    >
      SHARE
    </p>

    <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

  </div>

  <h2
    class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
    style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
  >
    分享作品
  </h2>

  <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

    <a
      id="x-share"
      href="#"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
    >
      X
    </a>

    <button
      type="button"
      id="instagram-share"
      class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
    >
      Instagram
    </button>

    <button
      type="button"
      id="copy-url"
      class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
    >
      复制URL
    </button>

  </div>

</div>

</div>

</Container>

</section>

<script>
  const pageUrl =
    "https://www.nishikinolab.net/zh-cn/edoninomarugarden/";

  const sharePhrases = [
    "找到这个了。",
    "这个莫名有点喜欢。",
    "看看这个。",
    "发现了个挺让人在意的东西。",
    "发现了这个。",
    "你知道这个吗？",
    "发现了个东西。",
    "原来还有这个。",
    "发现了个有点在意的东西。"
  ];

  const randomPhrase =
    sharePhrases[Math.floor(Math.random() * sharePhrases.length)];

  const shareText =
    `${randomPhrase} Minecraft 江户城二之丸庭园 | WORKS`;

  const xShareButton = document.getElementById("x-share");
  const copyButton = document.getElementById("copy-url");
  const instagramButton = document.getElementById("instagram-share");

  if (xShareButton) {
    xShareButton.setAttribute(
      "href",
      `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
    );
  }

  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

    try {

      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      if (copyButton) {

        copyButton.textContent = "已复制";

        setTimeout(() => {
          copyButton.textContent = "复制URL";
        }, 2000);

      }

    } catch (error) {

      console.error(error);

    }

  });

  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog = document.createElement("div");

    dialog.innerHTML = `
      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >

        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            在Instagram上分享
          </h3>

          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            复制此作品页面的URL后<br>
            打开Instagram。
          </p>

          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            复制URL并打开Instagram
          </button>

          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            取消
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>
    `;

    document.body.appendChild(dialog);

    const overlay = document.getElementById(
      "instagram-share-overlay"
    );

    const openButton = document.getElementById(
      "instagram-open"
    );

    const cancelButton = document.getElementById(
      "instagram-cancel"
    );

    openButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

      try {

        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      } catch (error) {

        console.error(error);

      }

      window.open(
        "https://www.instagram.com/",
        "_blank",
        "noopener,noreferrer"
      );

      overlay?.remove();

    });

    cancelButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

      overlay?.remove();

    });

    overlay?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {

      if (event.target === overlay) {

        overlay.remove();

      }

    });

  });
</script>

<style>

.work-hero{
  animation:heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;
  transform-origin:center;
}

@keyframes heroFloat{

0%{
transform:scale(1.03) translateY(0);
}

50%{
transform:scale(1.06) translateY(-18px);
}

100%{
transform:scale(1.03) translateY(0);
}

}

section{
position:relative;
}

section::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
left:0;
top:0;
width:100%;
height:100%;
pointer-events:none;
background-image:
radial-gradient(circle at 8% 10%,rgba(205,175,98,.08),transparent 18%),
radial-gradient(circle at 92% 82%,rgba(205,175,98,.06),transparent 22%);
}

aside{
position:sticky;
top:120px;
height:max-content;
}

a{
transition:.35s;
}

@media(max-width:1100px){

section{
overflow:hidden;
}

}

@media(max-width:900px){

aside{
position:relative;
top:auto;
}

}

@media(max-width:768px){

section:first-child{
height:760px;
}

.work-hero{
animation:none;
}

}

/* =====
   GALLERY GRADIENT FRAME
   照片渐变边框【皇居 江户城】【二之丸庭园】东京都千代田区
明治时代以前，这里曾是德川幕府的居城（江户城）。明治元年成为皇居，自明治21年起称为宫城，昭和23年废止宫城这一名称后改称皇居。
皇居内设有用于举行各种仪式的「宫殿」、宫内厅相关办公建筑以及「红叶山御养蚕所」等建筑，
其中一角设有桃华乐堂等建筑的「皇居东御苑（旧江户城本丸、二之丸、三之丸）」。
==== */

.gallery-frame {
  position: relative;
  padding: 2px;
  border-radius: 1.25rem;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow: hidden;
}

.gallery-frame img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;

  border-radius: calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background: #f8f6f2;
}

.gallery-frame:hover {
  background:
    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );
}

</style>

</Layout>